   "author": "Hakeem Shibly",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/hakeemshibly_companies-are-still-hiring-swes-you-just-activity-7516604871546994689-Q-LR",
   "text": "Companies are still hiring SWEs, you just need to know where to look. New Levels.fyi data from our negotiation service shows which companies are extending offers and interviewing candidates right now.\n\nThis past month, candidates working with the Levels.fyi negotiation team held offers or reached late-stage interviews at 58 companies. Every company here has a real candidate at the finish line in October.\n\nGoogle, Meta, Apple, Amazon, Microsoft and NVIDIA are on it, as you\u2019d expect. \n\nBut the other companies on the list are what\u2019s more interesting. Roughly organized by industry:\n- AI: Sakana AI, Etched, Trajectory Labs, PBC, Logical Intelligence, Typeface\n- Fintech: Addepar, Airwallex, Firebl",
