  "7516560054989328384": {
   "created": 1792087568,
   "author": "Gene Dai",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/genedai_on-oct-12-i-pulled-the-ai-startups-in-sf-activity-7516560054989328384-qtqe",
   "text": "On Oct 12 I pulled the AI startups in SF and New York that were hiring recruiters, and kept only the ones where I could confirm who runs talent. 10 made it.\n\nHow they made the list: raised a round in the 12 months before Oct 12, grew headcount more than 75% over the past year (year-over-year change in employee count), and had at least 2 recruiting roles open. 26 recruiting roles across the 10:\n\n1) Serval - agentic AI (5 recruiting roles, Carlos Lezama, Head of Talent)\n2) DualEntry - AI accounting / ERP (4 recruiting roles, Shweta Sharma, Head of Talent)\n3) Etched - transformer ASIC chips (3 recruiting roles, Corey Richard, Head of Talent Strategy)\n4) Fluidstack - GPU cloud for AI training (2",
